 "_about": "Every user-facing control on the guarded surfaces (DR-0726). The gate app/src/__tests__/feature-presence.test.jsx renders each surface and fails with a plain 'Missing: ...' list when a registered control is gone. Moving or restyling a control: update its entry's find. A feature leaves ONLY by moving its entry to 'removed' with removedBecause and a DR reference.",
 "_locators": "find takes exactly one of: testid (preferred); role + name (a substring of aria-label, else text); role + nameMatch (a regular expression); selector (an id a label points at); source (a pin in the app shell, which jsdom cannot render).",
